investigation/ideas/03_training_only_conformal_rank_scale_selection/program_1\nREF KEYS dict_keys(['campaign_results_dir', 'count', 'generated_at', 'queries', 'reference_query_plan', 'references', 'results_dir'])\nref.s2.dbd9297a5b5ed54ad277aabcadcb5fc1636d9073 Distribution-Free Predictive Inference for Regression None dict_keys(['citation_count', 'citation_key', 'id', 'paper_id', 'query', 'retrieved_at', 'source_url', 'title', 'venue', 'year'])\nref.s2.72532e45de02de57ebf760f0085bbef8c995b789 Adaptive Conformal Prediction Intervals Using Data-Dependent Weights With Application to Seismic Response Prediction None \nref.s2.e039609b77f457314217986e384bfbff97e59fda Residual Reweighted Conformal Prediction for Graph Neural Networks None \nref.s2.4590aa5e92037498f77f32e194ea8812b97347b9 Approximating Full Conformal Prediction for Neural Network Regression with Gauss-Newton Influence None \nref.s2.9728def9fff7fc392bb3be0396fef05f2c9aa735 Geometry-Aware Uncertainty Quantification via Conformal Prediction on Manifolds None \nref.s2.3b8247691dc3020023e47cd5a09897b9247dbf96 LoBoost: Model-Native Local Conformal Prediction for Gradient-Boosted Trees None \nref.s2.9d4deaa92dcb71595253d1044766c04089463716 Conformalized Regression for Continuous Bounded Outcomes None \nref.s2.c98b8506f0e9af9d19ce11c27d8364a376b3b993 Comparison of Sentinel-2 and Landsat 8 imagery for forest variable prediction in boreal region None \nref.s2.66f420b2e5c359f32f71a64d656c6a9e7b8c8224 Selection and Aggregation of Conformal Prediction Sets None \nref.s2.0b7b3218e90c2d7c4bee82f327c6578629437fc4 Operational solar flare prediction model using Deep Flare Net None \nref.s2.4a1db9bf29f4e2474f01e01e5f2a8339682b4e9c Deep learning-powered radiotherapy dose prediction: clinical insights from 622 patients across multiple sites tumor at a single institution None \nref.s2.0e06503ea03bbf7818eb20e5ddd8b35ce01f7c5a Prediction Model of Anastomotic Leakage Among Esophageal Cancer Patients After Receiving an Esophagectom